{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"5020f49476cd9819993b84058213381622a91c144909d3857c52e9f0c6eddab8","ja":"父親対策会議！","zh":"父亲对策会议！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8b556dd0bee0531c0f35ea480710cbe3c51a3cc4e050a0667ed792a904bc24af","ja":"「歌織は預かった。返してほしければ、\nお泊り会を認めるのだ……」","zh":"“歌织在我们手上。想要她平安回去的话，\n就答应举办过夜派对吧……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"22d858e77aea145689c723fd7fb4a7114dbffb5030877408c5b6ea358e6488e0","ja":"いい感じじゃない♪\nもうちょっと声を低くしたほうが迫力がでるかもね。","zh":"挺不错的嘛♪\n声音要是再低沉一点，可能会更有魄力哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"cb84d52710c18a8a3361a421ab65a1f1dd399e2fa49da09c79c73d101a007e07","ja":"あまり迫力がありすぎるのは危ないかも。\n真に受けて、警察に電話しちゃったら大変だし……。","zh":"太有震慑力可能会很危险吧。\n要是当真报了警，事情可就闹大了……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"386fa632777b2a386eb56bc5c1822435572e9877b5357663471a76c8ddd7a72b","ja":"警察！？　おおごとになると困りますね。お蕎麦じゃ\nなくてカツ丼で年越しすることになっちゃうかも。","zh":"警察！？　事情闹大可就麻烦了呢。说不定过年就\n不能吃荞麦面，只能吃着炸猪排饭跨年了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"9d0b4b752c1f9c2e0a5435a2f3054262ec06be5e435d4a4b860178ff948449f6","ja":"仕方ないわね……なら、他の作戦よ。\n交渉するなら、相手の弱点を攻めるのが有効だわ。","zh":"真拿你没办法……那就换别的作战吧。\n要是想交涉，攻击对方的弱点才最有效。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"967457e1ccee7a68e26e139195394e2f2ea6abeb30f1fa0fc3c59dbe9d8956f7","ja":"ええっ！？　父の弱点……。\nどうしよう、パッとは思いつかないかも……。","zh":"诶！？　父亲的弱点……\n怎么办，一下子可能想不出来……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"23455dc7734c358fbb857a65790a6a3a0a7648b1f79d5490b5c87c4ec1bbaed7","ja":"弱点が浮かばない……。\n歌織さんって、お父さん似なんですね。","zh":"想不出什么弱点啊……\n歌织长得很像父亲呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a2ed27a0bb138cf2ca64337c7ffe33cb8dce20ffaf6a56beeb9633b742a2a362","ja":"それなら、正々堂々と熱意を伝えるのが一番じゃ\nないでしょうか！　「どうしても行きたいの！」って！","zh":"既然如此，堂堂正正地传达热情不是最好的办法\n吗！比如跟她说“我无论如何都想去嘛！”这样！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2b272883b77e5d938e7963eac21d8e7768f43ed8d4e86c30f13219cb94d3cf71","ja":"たしかにお願いの仕方が甘かったかも……。\nわかったわ、もう一度言ってみる。","zh":"确实是我拜托的方式太欠考虑了……\n我知道了，我再去说一次。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4566b89ea589e3c952af0b6142d0566d22a6e65b5195298815d8bfe42365c236","ja":"ふたりとも、ありがとう！\n私のためにいろいろ考えてくれて。","zh":"谢谢你们两个人！\n为我想了这么多。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"82a2fd339ee4348680ba57f31c82ebeea20c84c1346f0d91958b75477162be15","ja":"いえ、歌織さんにも好きなように年末年始を\n過ごしていただきたいですから！","zh":"不用，我也希望歌织能按照自己的想法\n好好度过年末年初！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d00d06686db3e187814d729de008b06286c880cd0a702d2b3547f66d4ece61cc","ja":"ええ。歌織のやりたいことをするのが一番よ！\nだから自分の気持ちを優先させなさい！","zh":"嗯。去做歌织想做的事才是最好的！\n所以要优先考虑自己的心意才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2eba61495f4fefd9989ef9b158dc0652cee5ec88b4e6e267fc9befec9a059765","ja":"「私のやりたいことをする」……か。\nうん、そうよね。","zh":"“做自己想做的事”……吗。\n嗯，是啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1132.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2551ddc3bad65b43a59cb90aa0ccedb33db8365f7d7d7cffa8d07ddfad01fa90","ja":"分かったわ！\nそれじゃあ私、今から電話してくるね！","zh":"我知道了！\n那我这就去打电话哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
